<title>MALAYSIA: Ganad in Cambodia advertising deal.</title>
<headline>Ganad in Cambodia advertising deal.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ganad Corp Bhd said its Ganad-Khmer Advertising Co Ltd has been granted outdoor advertising rights by the Phnom Penh Municipality in Cambodia for the entire Phnom Penh city.</p>
<p>In a statement sent late on Monday, the operator of advertising billboards said Ganad-Khmer's rights allow it to control more than 50 percent of the total of outdoor advertising locations available in the Cambodian city.</p>
<p>It did not disclose the value of the rights.</p>
<p>Ganad said Ganad-Khmer's goal is to capture 70 percent of the outdoor advertising spending in Cambodia.</p>
<p>(( -- Kuala Lumpur newsroom 603 201 4813))</p>
